<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.7 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.7 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Monday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the</p>
<p>rest of the month was 5.7 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Jan 15			8,200</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Jan		6,319</p>
<p> Average reserves to Jan 12			   7,311</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,707</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
